IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "LANCE: I’ve been waiting for you.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "I knew that you, with your skills,\n"
	.string "would eventually reach me here.\p"
	.string "There’s no need for words now.\p"
	.string "We will battle to determine who is\n"
	.string "the stronger of us.\p"
	.string "As the most powerful trainer and as\n"
	.string "the POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION...\p"
	.string "I, LANCE the dragon master, accept\n"
	.string "your challenge!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1Defeat1::
	.string "...It’s over.\p"
	.string "But it’s an odd feeling.\p"
	.string "I’m not angry that I lost. In fact, I\n"
	.string "feel happy.\p"
	.string "Happy that I witnessed the rise\n"
	.string "of a great new CHAMPION!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1Victory1::
	.string "$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "...Whew.\p"
	.string "You have become truly powerful,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "Your POKéMON have responded to your\n"
	.string "strong and upstanding nature.\p"
	.string "As a trainer, you will continue to\n"
	.string "grow strong with your POKéMON.$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_3::
	.string "MARY: Oh, no!\n"
	.string "It’s all over!\p"
	.string "PROF.OAK, if you weren’t so slow...$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_4::
	.string "PROF.OAK: Ah, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "It’s been a long while.\p"
	.string "You certainly look more mature.\p"
	.string "Your conquest of the LEAGUE is just\n"
	.string "fantastic!\p"
	.string "Your dedication, trust and love for\n"
	.string "your POKéMON made this happen.\p"
	.string "Your POKéMON were outstanding too.\p"
	.string "Because they believed in you as a\n"
	.string "trainer, they persevered.\p"
	.string "Congratulations, {PLAYER}!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_5::
	.string "???: WHAT!?$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_6::
	.string "CARLOS: I cannot believe it...\p"
	.string "You actually defeated the ELITE\n"
	.string "FOUR?\p"
	.string "How could you!?\p"
	.string "How could you do this to my\n"
	.string "dream...!\p"
	.string "Have you enjoyed doing this to me?\p"
	.string "I’m so... SO upset!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_7::
	.string "CARLOS: ...\p"
	.string "It’s time...\p"
	.string "It’s time to settle this...\p"
	.string "Since you are the new CHAMPION,\n"
	.string "all I have to do is defeat you,\l"
	.string "right?\p"
	.string "Then...\p"
	.string "Let’s end this, CHAMPION!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1Defeat2::
	.string "Nooooo....!!!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1Victory2::
	.string "$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_8::
	.string "CARLOS: Hmmm...\p"
	.string "I don’t understand...\p"
	.string "Why are you so strong?\p"
	.string "Is it because my captured POKéMON\n"
	.string "here in JOHTO are weak?\p"
	.string "Does it mean I should go and get my\n"
	.string "other POKéMON?\p"
	.string "I thought I had a chance with them,\n"
	.string "but I was wrong...$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_9::
	.string "CARLOS: Listen you!\p"
	.string "You better be careful, because\n"
	.string "next time I won’t be as friendly as\l"
	.string "before...\p"
	.string "Next time, I’ll present you my real\n"
	.string "strength!\p"
	.string "So keep on training, because I\n"
	.string "wouldn’t like to battle you being\l"
	.string "so weak!\p"
	.string "Hehehe...\p"
	.string "Till then, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "Hahahahaha!!!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_10::
	.string "MARY: Wow... You even defeated\n"
	.string "that mean guy!\p"
	.string "Alright, let’s interview the brand\n"
	.string "new CHAMPION!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_11::
	.string "LANCE: This is getting to be a\n"
	.string "bit too noisy...\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, could you come with me?$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior7_Text_Trigger1_12::
	.string "MARY: Oh, wait!\n"
	.string "We haven’t done the interview!$"
